# Committed documentation images — NOT build output. The sample-snapshot names above are
# unanchored, so they match at any depth: `overlays.png` silently swallowed the gallery image of
# the same name (it never got committed, and the README rendered a broken image). `controls.png`
# and `popups.png` were the same trap waiting to happen. Re-include the whole directory.
!docs/screenshots/**

